    "enUS": {
      "description": "The keg is stamped:\r\n\r\nBLASTING POWDER - DANGER - DO NOT HANDLE - DANGER - QUARRYMASTER AUTHORIZATION ONLY - DANGER\r\n\r\nYou get a sinking feeling that the troggs shouldn't have this. It would be best to report this to the quarry sooner rather than later.",
      "dialogue": {
        "06a75bfd98112fc25dc1": "<The dwarf turns pale as he sees the empty keg.>\n\n...Where did you find this?",
        "2a60d2b49bac86f27820": "What's that you've got?"
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Empty Powder Keg to Quarrymaster Thesten at Gol'Bolar Quarry.",
      "title": "Stolen Blasting Powder",
